---
import AboutButton from "./AboutButton.astro";
import Highlight from "./Highlight.astro";
import Me from "../assets/Me.png";
---

<div class="py-40 px-15 flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-9/12 h-full">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-text-main text-center pb-10">
        Daniel Sereno Fernadez
    </h1>
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text-accent pb-5">
        Devops Engineer
    </h2>
    <h3 class="max-w-3xl text-xl font-bold text-text-main text-center">
        Automating the future, one pipeline at a time — empowering teams with efficient CI/CD workflows and intelligent infrastructure
    </h3>
    <section class="pt-30 flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-center items-center w-full h-full gap-10">
        <figure class="flex-shrink-0 self-center w-120 flex justify-center items-center">
            <img src={Me.src} alt="Chico saludando" class="w-120 h-150"/>
        </figure>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-4/12 pt-30 min-w-100">
            <nav class="pb-7 flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center w-full">
                <AboutButton href="">
                    CV
                </AboutButton>
                <AboutButton href="">
                    GITHUB
                </AboutButton>
                <AboutButton href="">
                   LINKEDIN
                </AboutButton>
                <AboutButton href="">
                    MALT
            </nav>
            <p class="pl-7 pr-7 pb-7 pt-7 bg-white/3 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl border border-white/20 shadow-md hover:border-button hover:shadow-lg hover:scale-110 scale-100 transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out w-10/12 card-hover-effect"> 
                Hello there👋, I am a DevOps Engineer focused on <Highlight>automation</Highlight>, <Highlight>continuous integration</Highlight>, and efficient deployment pipelines.
                I have hands-on experience with tools like <Highlight>Jenkins</Highlight>, <Highlight>Docker</Highlight>, <Highlight>SonarQube</Highlight>, <Highlight>Artifactory</Highlight>, and <Highlight>Bitbucket</Highlight>, creating <Highlight>CI/CD</Highlight> processes that streamline the software development lifecycle. I work primarily in <Highlight>AWS</Highlight> environments and am currently pursuing <Highlight>AWS certifications</Highlight> to deepen my cloud expertise. I'm passionate about <Highlight>infrastructure as code</Highlight>, <Highlight>observability</Highlight>, and continuous improvement in cloud-native environments. I hold a <Highlight>Master degree in Artificial Intelligence</Highlight>, field I am passionate about.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>